msgid "Toggle display of the status bar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:755
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Full Path</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:759
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggle display of the full file path in the titlebar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:764
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Document Tabs</guisubmenu>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:768
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Change display of tabs for all current documents. The tab can be displayed "
"above or below the editor window, or hidden. You may find the tabs more "
"convenient than the document menu for switching documents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:774
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Conversion Field</guisubmenu>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:778
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Change display of the value conversion field.</action> It can be "
"embedded in the main window, made a floating window or hidden."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:784
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Searchbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:788
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Change display of the value search bar</action>. It can be displayed "
"above or below the editor window, or hidden."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:793
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save Settings</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:797
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save the current state of the options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:802
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:806
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change application action shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:810
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &khexedit;...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:814
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change these settings:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:817
#, no-c-format
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Presentacion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:818
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Line and column size (in bytes). These can be set separately for different "
"modes. Fixed number of bytes per line. Lock column at end of line. Grid "
"lines between rows and columns. Width of field separators, spacing and "
"margins."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:824
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:825
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Blink rate and shape of the cursor. Behavior of the cursor when the window "
"loses focus."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:829
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font"
msgstr "Poliça"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:830
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Font name, style and size. Character used to display non printing characters "
"in the text field."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Colors"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:836
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All colors in &khexedit; can be customized, including odd and even lines and "
"columns, bookmarks, separators and grid lines. The one exception is the "
"selection color, which uses the setting chosen in the &kde; Control Center."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:842
#, no-c-format
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Fichièrs"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:843
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opening of the last, or all recent documents on startup. Restoration of "
"cursor position. Write protection enabled by default. Make a backup upon "
"saving files. Saving of <quote>Recent Documents</quote> list on exit. The "
"<quote>Recent Documents</quote> list can also be cleared in this dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:850
#, no-c-format
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "Divèrs"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:851
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Automatic copy to clipboard upon selection. Startup in insert mode, rather "
"than overwrite. Confirmation required for wrapping to the beginning or end "
"during searches. Cursor jumps to nearest byte when moved in binary mode. "
"Sound on typing input or fatal failure. Display of bookmarks in the offset "
"column and editor fields. Warning when number of printable pages exceeds a "
"settable limit. Maximum number of undos."
msgstr ""

